        <mxCell id="storage" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:24px;color:#7650A4;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.24&quot;&gt;TẦNG 3 · FILE STORAGE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:20px;color:#20364D;line-height:1.24;margin-top:9px&quot;&gt;APP_STORAGE_DIR riêng&lt;br&gt;CV PDF ≤ 5 MiB • API-17&lt;br&gt;Logo tùy chọn ≤ 2 MiB • API-42&lt;br&gt;Kiểm quyền / chữ ký file; không lộ key;&lt;br&gt;dọn file mới khi rollback, file cũ sau commit.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F0FC;strokeColor=#CDBCE2;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;fontColor=#20364D;" parent="1" vertex="1">
